      "id": "theverge-2026-05-19-here-are-our-favorite-memorial-day-deals-so-far",
      "title": "Here are our favorite Memorial Day deals (so far)",
      "summary": "Portable bluetooth speakers like the Charge 6 and Flip 7 are just a few on sale for Memorial Day.\t\n\nMemorial Day marks the unofficial start of summer, and the holiday’s sales include plenty of deals on gadgets that can help you make the most of the season. If your plans involve beach days, pool parties, or backyard barbecues, now’s a great time to pick up a portable Bluetooth speaker, as many of o",
      "body": "Memorial Day marks the unofficial start of summer, and the holiday’s sales include plenty of deals on gadgets that can help you make the most of the season. If your plans involve beach days, pool parties, or backyard barbecues, now’s a great time to pick up a portable Bluetooth speaker, as many of our favorite models are currently on sale. You’ll also find worthwhile TV deals, along with discounts on smart thermostats to help keep your home cool and your energy costs low. And, if you’re planning on heading out of town, there are deals on noise-canceling headphones, portable chargers, and other travel-friendly gadgets.\nBelow, we’ve rounded up the best Memorial Day deals currently available. To give you more options as you shop, we’ve included good deals from a range of retailers, including ones that aren’t running their own Memorial Day sales.\nBose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds (2nd Gen)\nRay-Ban Meta (Gen 1) smart glasses\nBose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones (first-gen)\nRing Battery Doorbell Plus (second-gen)\n[Product: Bose QuietComfort Ultra Earbuds (2nd Gen) | https://www.amazon.com/Bose-New-QuietComfort-Ultra-Earbuds/dp/B0F7M3HPBD?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FBose-QuietComfort-Ultra-Earbuds-II-Wireless-Noise-Cancelling-Earbuds-White%2F15864510101, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fbose-quietcomfort-ultra-2nd-gen-true-wireless-noise-cancelling-in-ear-earbuds-black%2FJ7C5V6WCKZ]\n* Samsung’s Galaxy Buds 3 Pro are on sale for $149.99 ($100 off) at Best Buy, which matches their all-time low price. The wireless earbuds are our top pick for Samsung Galaxy phone device owners, thanks to their comfortable AirPods-inspired design, terrific sound quality, and good noise cancellation. They also offer helpful voice controls that let you adjust volume or playback without a wake word, while delivering excellent voice call quality. Read our review.\n[Product: Nothing Ear (a) | https://www.amazon.com/Nothing-Ear-Integration-Cancelling-Equaliser/dp/B0CXPRP216/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fus.nothing.tech%2Fproducts%2Fear-a%3FColour%3DBlack]\n* Sennheiser’s Momentum True Wireless 4 earbuds are down to $199.99 ($100 off) at Amazon and Best Buy, which is $20 shy of their best price to date. If sound quality matters most, they’re an easy recommendation, delivering rich, detailed audio with EQ customization to fine-tune the listening experience. Optional wing tips are included to help keep them secure and comfortable. Read our review.\n[Product: Bose QuietComfort Ultra Headphones (first-gen) | https://www.amazon.com/Bose-QuietComfort-Bluetooth-Headphones-Cancelling/dp/B0CN9FTKJ4/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fbose-quietcomfort-ultra-wireless-noise-cancelling-over-the-ear-headphones-lunar-blue%2FJ7C5V6TTQR]\n[Product: Sony WH-1000XM5 | https://www.amazon.com/Sony-WH-1000XM5-Canceling-Headphones-Hands-Free/dp/B09XS7JWHH/?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fsony-wh-1000xm5-wireless-noise-canceling-over-the-ear-headphones-black%2FJ7XSRH5CXG%2Fsku%2F6505727%2F, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fsony-wh-1000xm5-bluetooth-wireless-noise-canceling-headphones-black%2F-%2FA-86314264]\n* Amazon and Best Buy are selling the last-gen AirPods Max (USB-C) for $449 ($100 off), which is $50 shy of their all-time low. Apple’s luxe over-ear headphones offer a premium design and work especially well with other Apple devices. They still deliver great sound quality and effective noise cancellation, even if the newer model has a slight edge. Read our review.\n[Product: Shokz OpenRun Pro 2 | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fshokz-openrun-pro-2-wireless-bone-conduction-open-ear-bluetooth-sports-headphones-steel-blue%2FJ3GWPSGPHG]\n[Product: Sonos Move 2 | https://www.amazon.com/Sonos-Move-Wireless-Portable-Bluetooth/dp/B0CGGYYK2D/?tag=theverge02-20, https://sonos.sjv.io/c/482924/2804767/32256?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.sonos.com%2Fen-us%2Fshop%2Fmove-2, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fsite%2Fsonos-move-2-portable-durable-smart-speaker-each-olive%2F6580298.p%3FskuId%3D6580298]\n* JBL’s Flip 7 speaker is on sale for $99.95 ($50 off) at Amazon and Best Buy,&nbsp; which matches its best price to date. The portable Bluetooth speaker builds on the Flip 6 with more durable IP68 dust and water resistance and improved sound that can reach higher volumes without sounding harsh. JBL’s new PushLock system also lets you easily swap in accessories, like the included wrist strap.\n* Bose’s SoundLink Plus is down to $209 ($50 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and directly from Bose, which is its second-best price this year and $30 shy of its all-time low. In his review, The Verge’s John Higgins called it a “great beach speaker,” as it offers impressively loud sound for its size, up to 20 hours of battery life, and a durable IP67-rated design that can handle pool days. Read our review.\n[Product: JBL Charge 6 | https://www.amazon.com/JBL-Charge-Waterproof-Drop-Proof-Built/dp/B0DN35M7S9/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fjbl-charge-6-portable-wireless-speaker-2025-black%2FJ7LXFW3J5H%2Fsku%2F6611485, https://rei.pxf.io/c/482924/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2F255217%2Fjbl-charge-6-bt-speaker]\n* Bose’s SoundLink Micro is on sale for $99 ($30 off) at Amazon and Best Buy , matching its all-time low price. It’s a good pick if you want something more portable than the larger SoundLink Plus. It won’t deliver the same room-filling sound, but it’s pocket-friendly, features a rugged IP67 design, and offers up to 12 hours of battery life, making it easier to take on the go.\n* The portable Beats Pill speaker is on sale for $99.99 ($50 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and Walmart. The pill-shaped speaker improves on its predecessor with up to 24 hours of battery life on a single charge, while adding two-way USB-C charging and lossless audio support. It also introduces an IP67-rated design and native Find My support on both Android and iOS if it goes missing. Read our review.\n[Product: LG B5 OLED TV | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-48-class-b5-series-oled-ai-4k-uhd-smart-webos-tv-2025%2FJJ8VPZTK9F, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-55-class-b5-series-oled-ai-4k-uhd-smart-webos-tv-2025%2FJJ8VPZTKH9]\n[Product: LG C5 OLED TV | https://www.amazon.com/LG-Upscaling-Filmmaker-Orchestra-OLED77C5PUA/dp/B0DYQM4BDB/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Flg-65-class-c5-series-oled-evo-ai-4k-uhd-smart-webos-tv-2025%2FJJ8VPZTRG6]\n* Multiple configurations of Sony’s Bravia 8 II TV are on sale, with the 65-inch on sale for $2,598 at Amazon, Best Buy, and directly from Sony — its second-best price so far this year. Crowned the “king of TV” in Value Electronics’&nbsp;2025 shootout, the exceptionally bright OLED TV boasts excellent color accuracy and a snappy 120Hz refresh rate. It also runs on Google TV and supports both Apple AirPlay 2 and Google Cast. Read our review.\n[Product: Amazon Fire TV Stick 4K Plus | https://www.amazon.com/Amazon-newest-AI-powered-Search-million/dp/B0F7Z4QZTT/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Famazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-plus-newest-model-ai-powered-fire-tv-search-wi-fi-6-streaming-device-8-gb-free-live-tv-black%2FJ39TLS6QVZ%2Fsku%2F6644638, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Famazon-fire-tv-stick-4k-2024%2F-%2FA-91651394]\n* If you want a little more speed and storage than Amazon’s Fire TV Stick 4K Plus offers, its 4K Max is&nbsp;on sale for $39.99 ($20 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and Target, which is $5 shy of its all-time low. It, too, runs on the new and improved Fire TV OS and supports Dolby Vision, HDR10 Plus, and Dolby Atmos. However, it adds faster performance, double the storage (16GB), and Wi-Fi 6E support. It also comes with a more capable remote, the Alexa Voice Remote Enhanced, which adds a button for live TV channel listings. Read our review.\n[Product: Hisense CanvasTV | https://www.amazon.com/Hisense-65-Inch-CanvasTVTM-Vision-65S7N/dp/B0D2PNVJFT/?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fhisense-65-class-s7-series-canvastv-4k-qled-tv-with-hi-matte-display-and-ultraslim-wall-mount-2024%2FJ3Z9Z4234Y]\n* The latest&nbsp;Amazon Fire TV Cube&nbsp;is on sale at&nbsp;Amazon and Best Buy for $109.99 ($30 off), which is its second-best price of the year but $30 more than its all-time low. Amazon’s latest Fire TV Cube combines a 4K streaming box with an Echo speaker, letting you play music, stream content in Dolby Vision, HDR, and Dolby Atmos, and control your TV and other smart home devices with hands-free Alexa voice commands. It also supports Wi-Fi 6E for faster, more reliable connectivity.\n[Product: Samsung S95F | https://www.amazon.com/SAMSUNG-65-Inch-Processor-Xcelerator-Samsung/dp/B0DXN7QNF1?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fsamsung-65-class-s95f-series-oled-4k-uhd-samsungvision-ai-smart-tizen-tv-2025%2FJ3ZYG2VV3P, https://www.amazon.com/SAMSUNG-65-Inch-Processor-Xcelerator-Samsung/dp/B0DXMJFJ7W?tag=theverge02-20]\n[Product: Ring Battery Doorbell Plus (second-gen) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0F14N7HHH/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fring-battery-doorbell-plus-newest-model-retinal-2k-with-wide-angle-video-up-to-6x-zoom-night-vision-and-battery-pack-nickel-silver%2FJ39TLSRS6P%2Fsku%2F6672122, https://ring.pxf.io/c/482924/3022805/30431?u=https%3A%2F%2Fring.com%2Fproducts%2Fbattery-doorbell-plus-2nd-gen%2Fcolor%2Fpolishednightnavy]\n[Product: Ring Floodlight Cam Wired Pro | https://www.amazon.com/Ring-Floodlight-Cam-Wired-Pro/dp/B08FCWQWDZ/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fsite%2Fring-floodlight-cam-pro-with-2k-video-and-ring-vision-2-led-lights-dual-band-wi-fi-and-3d-motion-detection-white%2F6456121.p, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fp%2FRing-Floodlight-Cam-Pro-Smart-Wired-Outdoor-Security-Camera-with-2-LED-Lights-3D-Motion-Detection-Dual-Band-WiFi-White-B0CG6VFFVL%2F329107033]\n* Ecobee’s Smart Thermostat Premium is on sale for $229.99 ($30 off) at Amazon and directly from Ecobee, which is within $30 of its lowest price to date. The high-end&nbsp;smart thermostat can adjust temperatures based on where you are in your home, send alerts if your home gets too hot or cold while you’re away, and even track basic indoor air quality metrics like humidity, VOCs, and carbon dioxide. It also works well with Alexa, Siri, Apple Home, Google Home, SmartThings, and IFTTT, while doubling as a decent smart speaker. Read our review.\n* If you don’t need all the features offered by Ecobee’s top-tier model, Ecobee’s Smart Thermostat Enhanced is on sale for $169.99 ($30 off) at Amazon and directly from Ecobee, which is one of its better prices so far this year. It also adjusts temperatures based on whether anyone’s home and works with Alexa, Apple Home, Google Home, and SmartThings. Compared to the Premium model, though, you can’t use it as a doorbell, and it lacks indoor air quality monitoring and built-in voice control.\n* Ecobee’s Smart Thermostat Essential is on sale for $119.99 ($20 off) at Amazon and directly from Ecobee, which is also one of its better prices in recent months. The company’s most affordable thermostat covers the basics, letting you control your home’s temperature, create schedules in the app, and use Alexa, Apple Home, or Google Assistant. It also sends intruder alerts, but unlike Ecobee’s pricier models, it can’t automatically adjust temperatures based on activity in your home.\n[Product: Ecovacs Deebot X9 Pro Omni | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZXFNVQ2/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fecovacs-robotics-deebot-x9-pro-omni-robot-vacuum-mop-real-time-self-washing-mopping-blast-16600pa-suction-triple-auto-mop-lift-black%2FJ3R8442FWT, https://www.anrdoezrs.net/links/8836598/type/dlg/https://www.ecovacs.com/us/deebot-robotic-vacuum-cleaner/deebot-x9-pro-omni/]\n* If you want something even more capable, Ecovacs’ new Deebot X12 OmniCyclone is on sale for $1,249 ($250 off) at Amazon and directly from Ecovacs, matching its best price. The flagship is a more powerful with 22,000Pa suction, while offering a wider 10.6-inch roller mop that continuously rinses itself. It uses cameras and AI to detect dried stains, then sprays water and cleaning solution to help loosen stubborn messes before scrubbing them away.\n[Product: Ecobee Smart Doorbell Camera | https://www.amazon.com/ecobee-Smart-Video-Doorbell-Camera/dp/B0C424CVZ8/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fecobee-smart-video-doorbell-wired-with-advanced-person-and-package-detection-black%2FJXC53VLVQC, https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=nOD/rLJHOac&mid=46044&murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ecobee.com%2Fen-us%2Fsmart-doorbell-camera-wired%2F]\n[Product: Mammotion Luba 3 AWD 1500/H | https://www.amazon.com/Mammotion-LUBA-1500H-Dual-Camera-All-Wheel-Drive/dp/B0GKNYZPC3?tag=theverge02-20, https://us.mammotion.com/products/luba-2-awd-s-version-robot-lawn-mower?variant=49781966995754]\n* The Mill Food Recycler is on sale for $874 when you buy it directly from Mill, which isn’t quite its best price to date but still a nice discount on the clever kitchen appliance. Designed to help reduce food waste, the trash can transforms things like fruit peels, leftovers, and other scraps into a dry, compost-like material overnight, helping cut down on odors and the amount of trash your household produces.&nbsp;Read our review.\n[Product: Eve Energy Smart Plug | https://www.amazon.com/Eve-Energy-Matter-Control-SmartThings/dp/B0BZBGD87V?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Feve-energy-smart-plug-matter-white%2FJ3L3KQ4LQ6%2Fsku%2F6546393, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fp%2Feve-Energy-Matter-Smart-Plug-Matter-Thread-Enabled-works-w-Apple-Home-SmartThings-Alexa-Google-Home-White-10037863%2F326969071]\n[Product: Star Wars Outlaws | https://www.amazon.com/Star-Wars-Outlaws-Gold-Nintendo-Switch/dp/B0F79Z9V31/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FStar-Wars-Outlaws-PlayStation-5%2F5439978114%3F, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fsite%2Fstar-wars-outlaws-standard-edition-playstation-5%2F6578448.p%3F]\n* You can buy the physical version of Assassin’s Creed Shadows at Best Buy for $34.99 ($15 off) and Target. The open-world game follows a shinobi assassin and a powerful samurai caught in the midst of political unrest in feudal Japan. Its stealth mechanics are intuitive, and there’s a satisfying amount of action, too. Read our review.\n[Product: Xbox Wireless Controller | https://www.amazon.com/Xbox-Wireless-Gaming-Controller-Headsets-Console/dp/B0F1HX3WXX?th=1&tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.walmart.com/c/482924/565706/9383?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.walmart.com%2Fip%2FMicrosoft-Xbox-Wireless-Controller-Carbon-Black%2F15060559533, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fmicrosoft-xbox-wireless-controller-usb-c-cable-for-xbox-series-x-xbox-series-s-xbox-one-pcs-and-cloud-enabled-devices-carbon-black-usb-c%2FJJGXPXQX3L]\n[Product: Borderlands 4 | https://www.amazon.com/Borderlands-4-PlayStation-5/dp/B0FDBL8L41?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fborderlands-4-playstation-5%2FJXHY5RWCS3]\n[Product: iPad (2025) | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75TN5F/?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ76LW4J/?tag=theverge02-20, https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DZ75HDQ4/?tag=theverge02-20]\n* The latest 11-inch iPad Pro with 256GB of storage is down to $899 ($100 off) at Amazon and Best Buy, which is $100 shy of its all-time low. If you prefer a bigger screen, the 13-inch Wi-Fi model with 256GB of storage is also on sale for at Amazon and Best Buy for around $1,195 ($105 off). Apple’s newest iPad Pro is its fastest tablet yet, packing the M5 chip along with faster storage speeds, quicker charging, and a new N1 chip that handles wireless connectivity like Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and Thread. Read our review.\n[Product: MacBook Air (M5) | https://www.amazon.com/Apple-2026-MacBook-15-inch-Laptop/dp/B0GR1DVSQP/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2F15-inch-macbook-air-apple-m5-chip-with-10-core-cpu-and-10-core-gpu-16gb-memory-512gb-ssd-midnight%2FJJGCQLKQL9%2Fsku%2F657104]\n[Product: Anker Laptop Power Bank | https://www.amazon.com/Anker-Portable-Multi-Device-Charging-Retractable/dp/B0DMDJBCDP/?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fanker-laptop-power-bank-25k-165w-built-in-and-retractable-cables-black%2FJJ858RXPXJ, https://anker.pxf.io/c/482924/1543964/18023?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa1695-anker-power-bank-25000mah-165w]\n* If you need a reliable power bank, Anker’s Zolo Magnetic Power Bank (10,000mAh) is on sale for $39.99 ($10 off) at Amazon, which is $10 shy of its all-time low. The small battery pack can wirelessly charge iPhones at up to 7.5W, while the built-in USB-C cable delivers up to 30W fast charging for devices. It also doubles as an adjustable stand, making it handy for watching videos or keeping an eye on notifications while charging.\n[Product: Anker Nano Charger (45W, Smart Display, 180° Foldable) | https://www.amazon.com/Anker-Charging-Foldable-Recognition-Non-Battery/dp/B0G1MRLXMV?tag=theverge02-20, https://anker.pxf.io/c/482924/1543964/18023?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.anker.com%2Fproducts%2Fa121d-45w-usb-c-fast-charger-foldable-plug-compact]\n* Satechi’s 3-in-1 Foldable Wireless Charging Stand with Qi2 25W is on sale for $116.99 ($13 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and directly from Satechi, which is a new low price. The adjustable, foldable stand can wirelessly deliver up to 25W to compatible iPhones while simultaneously fast charging an Apple Watch and topping up your AirPods, but it also works with a range of Qi, Qi2, and Qi2.2-compatible Android phones and wireless earbuds. Satechi&nbsp;also includes a 45W USB-C adapter along with three international adapters, making it a useful travel companion.\n[Product: Jackery Explorer 500 | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SM5HBK1?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jackery.com%2Fproducts%2Fexplorer-500w-portable-power-station]\n* Goal Zero is taking 25 percent off a range of portable power stations, including the Yeti 700, which is currently $524.89 ($175 off). The portable power station can power up to nine devices at once through its AC, USB-C, USB-A, and 12V ports. Compared to the smaller Yeti 300 (on sale for $262.89) and Yeti 500 (on sale for $374.89), the higher-end model offers greater battery capacity and power output, making it a better fit for simultaneously running multiple laptops, phones, lights — or even small appliances.\n[Product: Dyson PencilWash | https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0GKJ1PYJZ/?tag=theverge02-20, https://goto.target.com/c/482924/81938/2092?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.target.com%2Fp%2Fdyson-pencilwash-cordless-wet-hard-floor-cleaner-brown%2F-%2FA-95266540%23lnk%3Dsametab, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.dyson.com%2Ffloor-cleaners%2Fwet%2Fpencilwash%2Fcopper]\n* The newer Ray-Ban Meta 2 smart glasses are also on sale for around $319 ($60 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and directly from Meta, which marks a new low price. They’re a minor upgrade over the last-gen model, with the biggest improvements being battery life and camera quality. The newer pair can last up to eight hours on a charge, which is double that of the original model, while the camera can capture sharper 3K video at 30fps. Read our review.\n[Product: Ray-Ban Meta (Gen 1) smart glasses | https://www.amazon.com/Ray-Ban-Smart-Glasses-Wayfarer-Shiny-Black/dp/B0CGXYM9TP?tag=theverge02-20, https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Fray-ban-meta-wayfarer-glasses-with-meta-ai-audio-photo-video-compatibility-green-lenses-shiny-black%2FBCKVZQ48PC, https://www.meta.com/ai-glasses/wayfarer-shiny-black-clear/]\n* The Insta360 Link 2 Pro is down to $229.99 ($20 off) at Amazon, Best Buy, and directly from Insta360. The premium 4K webcam uses a large 1/1.3-inch sensor for sharper image quality and better low-light performance than its predecessor, though its resolution still maxes out at 4K/30fps or 1080p at up to 60fps. It features a two-axis gimbal and dual microphones with AI noise cancellation, while retaining features like AI tracking to help keep you centered if you move around.\n[Product: Insta360 X5 | https://bestbuy.7tiv.net/c/482924/614286/10014?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bestbuy.com%2Fproduct%2Finsta360-x5-8k-360-action-camera-black%2FJ39VLT4C63, https://rei.pxf.io/c/482924/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2FC00518%2Finsta360-x5, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fstore.insta360.com%2Fproduct%2Fx5%2F]\n* The&nbsp;Dyson Airwrap i.d.&nbsp;is on sale for $499.99 ($150 off) from&nbsp;Best Buy&nbsp;and&nbsp;Dyson.&nbsp;The dryer can automatically adjust heat, airflow, and timing according to your styling preferences, with the app letting you set up a profile based on factors like your hair type, length, and skill level. From there, it can guide you through a more customized curling routine. Dyson also includes three attachments, including a conical barrel, a diffuser designed for waves and curls, and a blade concentrator.\n[Product: BioLite Site Lights | https://www.amazon.com/BioLite-Lights-Lanterns-Camping-Outdoors/dp/B0DXQV785H/?tag=theverge02-20, https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bioliteenergy.com%2Fproducts%2Fsolar-site-lights%2F, https://rei.pxf.io/c/482924/1448521/17195?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.rei.com%2Fproduct%2F248293%2Fbiolite-luci-site-lights]\n* The&nbsp;Amazfit Active 2&nbsp;is on sale for $89.99 ($10 off) at&nbsp;Best Buy, which is $10 shy of its lowest price to date. It’s a surprisingly capable budget fitness tracker, with features like continuous heart rate and blood oxygen monitoring, offline navigation, and battery life that can lasts up to nine days. Read our review.\n[Product: BioLite FirePit Plus | https://go.skimresources.com/?id=1025X1701640&xs=1&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.bioliteenergy.com%2Fproducts%2Ffirepit-plus, https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=cl&merchant_id=b5770911-39dc-46ac-ba0f-b49dbb30c5c7&website_id=0f9b0f6f-13ac-4498-8e0f-b3beae765e07&url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.backcountry.com%2Fbiolite-firepit]",
