      "summary": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peter_G._Neumann\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=48188787\nPoints: 279\n# Comments: 23",
      "body": "Mon May 18 03:58:33 AEST 2026\nPrevious message (by thread): [TUHS] time on bsd 2.11 on a pdp11\nNext message (by thread): [TUHS] RIP Peter Salus\nTom van Vleck just passed the below forwarded message on the Multics\nmailing list. Very sad news.\nFrom: Tom Van Vleck via groups.io <thvv=multicians.org at groups.io>\nDate: Sun, May 17, 2026, 1:27 PM\nSubject: [multicians] Peter Neumann has died\nUnfortunately, I email with the heartbreaking news that Peter Neumann\npassed away in his sleep last night, at the hospital in Santa Clara, due to\ncomplications arising from his fall and subsequent surgery a few weeks ago.\nHis daughter Hellie was with him at the hospital at the time, and they had\nbeen listening to classical music together — as you may know, music was\nanother of his great loves in life beyond computer security, with Peter an\naccomplished player of the piano, French horn, and various other\ninstruments. Hellie has asked me to reach out to his friends and colleagues\nwith this news — it’s still early in the morning in California and I will\nsend on more information in due course, but it is currently believed that\nSRI will host a memorial service for him in Menlo Park in a month or so.\nhttps://www.csl.sri.com/~neumann/ is Peter's SRI home page.\nHe was a wonderful friend and colleague.\nYou receive all messages sent to this group.\nView/Reply Online (#5960) <https://groups.io/g/multicians/message/5960> | Reply\n| Mute This Topic <https://groups.io/mt/119360690/481017> | New Topic\n-- sent via multicians at groups.io -- more Multics info at\nYour Subscription <https://groups.io/g/multicians/editsub/481017> | Contact\nGroup Owner <multicians+owner at groups.io> | Unsubscribe\nPrevious message (by thread): [TUHS] time on bsd 2.11 on a pdp11\nNext message (by thread): [TUHS] RIP Peter Salus\nMore information about the TUHS",
